OL,4,CPublic to have say on #600m fuel plant 
OL,5,Cplans                                  
OL,6,GResidents and businesses are being     
OL,7,Ginvited to have their say on plans for 
OL,8,Ga #600m fuel plant near Hull.          
OL,10,FLanzaTech wants to build the facility, 
OL,11,Fknown as DRAGON Humber, at Saltend     
OL,12,FChemicals Park, where it would produce 
OL,13,Fsustainable aviation fuel (SAF) and    
OL,14,Frenewable diesel.                      
OL,16,FThe company said the project would     
OL,17,Fcreate 50 permanent full-time jobs on  
OL,18,Fsite, alongside about 50 new           
OL,19,Femployment opportunities in the supply 
OL,20,Fchain.                                 
OL,22,                                   G1/4 
