OL,4,CCost of mayor's Indian trade mission   
OL,5,Ctrip revealed                          
OL,6,GThe cost to North Yorkshire taxpayers  
OL,7,Gof a mayoral trade mission to India    
OL,8,Gwas more than #85,000, recently        
OL,9,Greleased figures show.                 
OL,11,FDavid Skaith and eight staff from the  
OL,12,FYork and North Yorkshire Combined      
OL,13,FAuthority (YNYCA) were accompanied by  
OL,14,F12 external delegates on the trip to   
OL,15,FHyderabad and Mumbai last month.       
OL,17,FThe combined authority spent a total   
OL,18,Fof #85,102 on flights, stays at five-  
OL,19,Fstar hotels, and meals on the trip, a  
OL,20,FFreedom of Information (FOI) request   
OL,21,Fhas revealed.                          
OL,22,                                   G2/4 
OL,23,D]CNews IndexG102CFlashG150CRegionalG160
