OL,4,CTeen rape victim 'lost part of myself' 
OL,5,Cin attack                              
OL,6,GA teenage girl who was abducted from a 
OL,7,Gpark and raped told a court she had    
OL,8,G"lost part of myself" and hates being  
OL,9,Gout at night.                          
OL,11,FJay Savage, 33, grabbed the girl and   
OL,12,Fthreatened to stab her after he        
OL,13,Ffollowed her into a dark area of       
OL,14,FCentral Park in Boston, Lincolnshire,  
OL,15,Fin March.                              
OL,17,FLincoln Crown Court was told Savage    
OL,18,Fwas seen on CCTV marching the girl to  
OL,19,Fhis hotel, where he filmed himself     
OL,20,Fsexually assaulting her.               
OL,22,                                   G3/4 
OL,23,D]CNews IndexG102CFlashG150CRegionalG160
