OL,4,CMan in court after arson attack on     
OL,5,Ccity church                            
OL,6,GA man has appeared in court in         
OL,7,Gconnection with an arson attack which  
OL,8,Gcaused "substantial damage" to a       
OL,9,Gchurch in York city centre.            
OL,11,FSeveral fires inside Holy Trinity      
OL,12,FChurch on Micklegate were believed to  
OL,13,Fhave been started deliberately at      
OL,14,Fabout 12:00 GMT on Wednesday,          
OL,15,Faccording to North Yorkshire Police.   
OL,17,FSerious damage was caused to a "large  
OL,18,Fand listed historical altarpiece       
OL,19,Fwithin the church", a force            
OL,20,Fspokesperson said.                     
OL,22,                                   G4/4 
